<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Belgium Business Number matches a =
valid business number combined with any of the following keywords within a =
proximity of 10 terms:zakelijk id-nummer, zakelijk nr#, bedrijfsregistratie=
nummer (or) zakelijk nummer. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{10}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:zakelijk id-nummer|zakelijk nr\#?|bedrijf=
sregistratienummer|zakelijk nummer)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">3219854086</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Belgium Company Number matches a v=
alid company number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: Kruispuntbank voor Ondernemingen, Kruispuntbank van On=
dernemingen, ondernemingsnummer, KBO-nummer (or) KBO. (All terms case insen=
sitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:BE)?\d{10}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Kruispuntbank voor Ondernemingen|Kruispun=
tbank van Ondernemingen|ondernemingsnummer|KBO-nummer|KBO)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">BE3219854086,4317254321</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
