<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National Identity Card Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Hong Kong National ID Number match=
es a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following=
 keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: HKID, =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=
=E6=98=8E=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=
=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC (or) =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89 ID. (All terms case ins=
ensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{1,2}\d{6}[ ]?\(?[0-9A]\)?</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=
=8E=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E8=99=
=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89 ID)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">A123456(A)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">CPF number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Hong Kong Passport Number matches =
a valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within =
a proximity of 10 terms: =E5=9C=8B=E9=9A=9B=E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=BA=AB=E4=
=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=8E, =E8=AD=B7=E7=85=A7=E8=B3=87=E6=96=99, =E7=B0=BD=
=E8=AD=89, =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89, =E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=AD=89=E4=BB=
=B6, =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=8E=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6, =E8=BA=AB=E4=
=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=8E, =E8=AD=B7=E7=85=A7=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E8=AD=B7=
=E7=85=A7 ID (or) =E8=AD=B7=E7=85=A7.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{1,2}\d{6}[A-Z0-9]{1,2}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=E5=9C=8B=E9=9A=9B=E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=
=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=8E|=E8=AD=B7=E7=85=A7=E8=B3=87=E6=96=99|=E7=
=B0=BD=E8=AD=89|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89|=E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=AD=89=E4=
=BB=B6|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=8E=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6|=E8=BA=AB=E4=
=BB=BD=E8=AD=89=E6=98=8E|=E8=AD=B7=E7=85=A7=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E8=AD=B7=E7=
=85=A7 ID|=E8=AD=B7=E7=85=A7)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">A123456A</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Hong Kong Driver's License Number =
matches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: DVLA, =E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7=
=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC, =E6=96=B0=E6=89=8B=E5=8F=B8=E6=A9=9F, =E9=A7=95=E9=A7=
=9B=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E8=80=85, =E5=AE=9E=E4=B9=A0=E9=A9=
=BE=E7=85=A7 (or) =E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7. (All terms case ins=
ensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]\d{6}[ ]?[A-Z0-9]</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:DVLA|=E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7=
=E8=99=9F=E7=A2=BC|=E6=96=B0=E6=89=8B=E5=8F=B8=E6=A9=9F|=E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=
=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E8=80=85|=E5=AE=9E=E4=B9=A0=E9=A9=BE=
=E7=85=A7|=E9=A7=95=E9=A7=9B=E5=9F=B7=E7=85=A7)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">A123456 1</td>
