<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">Social Security Number</t=
h>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">NIN</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ff991f confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff99=
1f" rowspan=3D"2" title=3D"Background color : Dark orange 85%">National Ide=
ntity Card Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore National ID Number matches a valid Nat=
ional Identity Card number combined with any of the following keywords with=
in a proximity of 10 terms: NIN, NRIC, national id, national card number, n=
ational card no, Foreign Identification Number, FIN, national registration =
Identity Card, national identification number (or) national identity card n=
umber. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">[FGMST]\d{=
7}[A-JZ]</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|NRIC|national id|national card num=
ber|national card no|Foreign Identification Number|FIN|national registratio=
n Identity Card|national identification number|national identity card numbe=
r)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">S8076606H,=
 S6963118A</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5=
f7" rowspan=3D"2" title=3D"Background color : Light grey 100%">CPF number</=
th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Central Provident Fund Number matches =
a valid CPF number combined with any of the following keywords within a pro=
ximity of 10 terms: ID CPF, CPF code, CPF number, central provident fund nu=
mber, CPF identification number, CPF identification no, CPF ID, ID# CPF, CP=
F account number, CPF account (or) NRIC. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]\d{7}[A-Z]|[ST][A-DF]\d{6}[A-Z]</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:CPF code|CPF number|central provident fun=
d number|CPF identification number|CPF identification no|CPF ID\#?|ID#? CPF=
|CPF account number|CPF account|NRIC)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
