dentification Code|tax file|tax identification no|tax no#|tax no|tax regist=
ration number|taxid\#?|taxidno\#?|taxidnumber\#?|taxno\#?|taxnumber\#?|tin =
id|tin no|tax id|tin\#?)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
