</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Da=
te of birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ff991f confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff99=
1f" rowspan=3D"2" title=3D"Background color : Dark orange 85%">Phone number=
</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Phone Number matches a valid phone num=
ber combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 te=
rms: mobilephone number, mobile phone no., mobilephone no., mobile number, =
mobilenumber, mobile no., mobileno., mobile#, contact number, contact no., =
contact, fax number, fax no., cell phone number, cellphone number, cell pho=
ne no., cellphone no., cell phone, cellphone, cell number, cellnumber, cell=
 no., cellno., whatsapp number, whatsapp no., whatsapp, phone number, phone=
 no., phone num, telephonic number, telephone number, telephone no., teleph=
one, landline number, landline no. (or) landline num. (All terms case insen=
sitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">\d{4}[- ]?=
\d{4}|<span style=3D"color: rgb(0,51,102);">\+65[ -]?|(3|6|8|9)?\d{4}[ -]\d=
{4}</span></span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:mobilephone number|mobile phone no.|mobil=
ephone no.|mobile number|mobilenumber|mobile no.|mobileno.|mobile#|contact =
number|contact no.|contact|fax number|fax no.|cell phone number|cellphone n=
umber|cell phone no.|cellphone no.|cell phone|cellphone|cell number|cellnum=
ber|cell no.|cellno.|whatsapp number|whatsapp no.|whatsapp|phone number|pho=
ne no.|phone num|telephonic number|telephone number|telephone no.|telephone=
|landline number|landline no.|landline num)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))<=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">1234-5678,=
 1234 5678, <span style=3D"color: rgb(0,51,102);">+65-3423-2342</span></spa=
n></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#de350b confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#de35=
0b" title=3D"Background color : Dark red 85%">Physical address</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ff991f confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff99=
1f" rowspan=3D"2" title=3D"Background color : Dark orange 85%">Post code</t=
h>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Postcode matches a valid postcode comb=
ined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: pla=
ce of residence, postcode district, postcode area, postcode unit, postcode =
sector, Zip code, Postal code (or) postcode. (All terms case insensitive.)<=
/td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p class=3D"p1">((0[1-9]|[1-6][0-9]|7[0-8]|8[0-2=
])[0-9]{4})</p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:place of residence|postcode district|post=
code area|postcode unit|postcode sector|Zip codePostal code|postcode)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">119077,188=
065</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License plate number (i.e. vehicle=
)</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore License Plate Number matches a valid l=
icense plate number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: registration. no., plate. no., license number, license=
 plate number, registration number (or) license plate. (All terms case inse=
nsitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?!I|O)[A-Z]{1,3}[ .-]?\d{3,5}[ .-]?(?!I|O)[A-Z]=
|[A-HJ-NP-Z]{1,3}[ .-]?\d{3,5}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:registration. no.|plate. no.|license numb=
er|license plate number|registration number|license plate)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.=
#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">SBS 6216 G,MC 8018J,XE 2017D,A1234</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#de350b confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#de35=
0b" title=3D"Background color : Dark red 85%">Person name</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">IBAN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank account number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Bank Account Number matches a valid ba=
nk account number combined with any of the following keywords within a prox=
imity of 10 terms: bank account number, bank details, bank number, account =
code, account id, account number (or) numbered account.(All terms case inse=
nsitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{3})?\d{7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:bank account number|bank details|bank num=
ber|account code|account id|account number|numbered account)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1461720024</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Cr=
edit card number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Routing Number matches a valid routing=
 number combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 1=
0 terms: Singapore routing number, routing number, bankrouting#, routing#, =
routing no (or) RTN. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{3,4}|\d{7})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">((?i)(?:Singapore routing number|routing number|=
bankrouting#|routing#|routing no))|(RTN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td=
>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1231234</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Business Number matches a valid busine=
ss number combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of=
 10 terms: corporate identification number, company registration number, co=
rporate number, businessno#, businessid# (or) business ID. (All terms case =
insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{9,10}[A-Z]?)</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:corporate identification number|company r=
egistration number|corporate number|businessno#|businessid#|business ID)(?:=
\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">123456782L</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Singapore Company Number matches a valid company=
 number combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 1=
0 terms: corporate identification number, company registration number, corp=
orate number (or) company number.(All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{9,10}[A-Z]?)</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:corporate identification number|company r=
egistration number|corporate number|company number)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=
=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1234123456A</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch3Countries-China"><strong>China=
</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
