</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">Social Security Number</t=
h>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National Identity Card Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">China National ID Number matches a=
 valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following key=
words within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, NIN, =E5=9B=BD=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=
=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=E5=8F=B7=E7=A0=81 (or) =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=E5=
=8F=B7. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{6}[ ]?\d{4}(0[1-9]|1[0-2])(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3=
[01])\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|=E5=9B=BD=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=
=BD=E8=AF=81=E5=8F=B7=E7=A0=81|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=E5=8F=B7)(?:\b|(=
?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">123445123412129999</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">CPF number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">China Passport Number matches a va=
lid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: =E5=9B=BD=E9=99=85=E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=AF=81=E4=BB=B6=
, =E6=8A=A4=E7=85=A7=E8=AF=A6=E7=BB=86=E4=BF=A1=E6=81=AF, =E7=AD=BE=E8=AF=
=81, =E5=9B=BD=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81, =E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=
=AF=81=E4=BB=B6, =E5=8F=91=E8=AF=81=E6=9C=BA=E5=85=B3, =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=
=E8=AF=81=E4=BB=B6, =E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=E6=98=8E, =E6=8A=A4=E7=85=
=A7 ID, =E6=8A=A4=E7=85=A7=E5=8F=B7=E7=A0=81 (or) =E6=8A=A4=E7=85=A7.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">((0\d)|(1[0-2])|(2[1-9])|(3[0-2])|(6[1-9])|(7[01=
2])|80)(\d{7})|<span style=3D"color: rgb(0,51,102);">[A-z]\d{8}|[A-z]{2}\d{=
7}</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=E5=9B=BD=E9=99=85=E6=97=85=E8=A1=8C=E8=
=AF=81=E4=BB=B6|=E6=8A=A4=E7=85=A7=E8=AF=A6=E7=BB=86=E4=BF=A1=E6=81=AF|=E7=
=AD=BE=E8=AF=81|=E5=9B=BD=E6=B0=91=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81|=E6=97=85=E8=
=A1=8C=E8=AF=81=E4=BB=B6|=E5=8F=91=E8=AF=81=E6=9C=BA=E5=85=B3|=E8=BA=AB=E4=
=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=E4=BB=B6|=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=E6=98=8E|=E6=8A=A4=E7=
=85=A7 ID|=E6=8A=A4=E7=85=A7=E5=8F=B7=E7=A0=81|=E6=8A=A4=E7=85=A7)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">011234567,<span style=3D"color: rgb(0,51,102);">=
AB1234567</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">China Driver's License Number matc=
hes a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords with=
in a proximity of 10 terms: DVLA, =E5=B8=A6=E7=85=A7=E7=89=87=E7=9A=84=E6=
=89=A7=E7=85=A7, =E5=AE=9E=E4=B9=A0=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7, =E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7=
=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E4=BA=BA, =E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E4=BA=BA,=
 =E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7=E5=8F=B7, =E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7=E5=8F=B7, =E6=AD=A3=E5=BC=
=8F=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7, =E6=B1=BD=E8=BD=A6=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7, =E9=A9=BE=E7=
=85=A7, =E6=B1=BD=E8=BD=A6=E9=A9=BE=E9=A9=B6=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7 (or) =E9=A9=
=BE=E9=A9=B6=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{6}[- ./][1-9]\d{3}[- ./]\d{2}[- ./]\d{2}[-=
 ./]\d{3}[- .]?\d{1}|\d{6}[- ./]\d{2}[- ./]\d{2}[- ./]\d{2}[- .]\d{3})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:DVLA|=E5=B8=A6=E7=85=A7=E7=89=87=E7=9A=84=
=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7|=E5=AE=9E=E4=B9=A0=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7|=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7=
=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E4=BA=BA|=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7=E6=8C=81=E6=9C=89=E4=BA=BA|=
=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7=E5=8F=B7|=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7=E5=8F=B7|=E6=AD=A3=E5=BC=8F=
=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7|=E6=B1=BD=E8=BD=A6=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7|=E9=A9=BE=E7=85=A7|=
=E6=B1=BD=E8=BD=A6=E9=A9=BE=E9=A9=B6=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7|=E9=A9=BE=E9=A9=B6=
=E6=89=A7=E7=85=A7)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">120214 2013-12-23 836 1,210486 43-08-16 298</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">Social Insurance Number</=
th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Tax ID number (i.e. Taxpayer ID number)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">China Tax ID Number matches a vali=
d Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywords wit=
hin a proximity of 10 terms: =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E5=8F=B7,=
 =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E7=99=BB=E8=AE=B0=E5=8F=B7, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=
=E5=88=AB=E7=A0=81, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=
=A1=E5=8F=B7#, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E5=8F=B7, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=
=88=AB=E5=8F=B7#, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E5=8F=B7, =E7=A8=8E=
=E5=8A=A1ID#, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E7=A0=81, =E7=A8=8E=E5=
=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=ABID, =E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=BA=AB=E4=BB=BD=E8=AF=81=
=E6=98=8E#, TIN (or) =E7=A8=8E=E5=8F=B7.<span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77)=
;"> (All terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{15}|\d{18}|\d{17}[X]|[CWHMT]\d{17}|[CWHMT]\d{=
16}[A-z]|J\d{14}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E5=
=8F=B7|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E7=99=BB=E8=AE=B0=E5=8F=B7|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=
=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E7=A0=81|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6|=E7=A8=8E=E5=
=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E5=8F=B7\#?|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=
=E5=8F=B7|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1ID\#?|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=E7=
=A0=81|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=AF=86=E5=88=ABID|=E7=A8=8E=E5=8A=A1=E8=BA=AB=
