=83 =C3=AEnmatriculare, placuta, matricula, masina (or) inregistrat. (All t=
erms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{1,2}[ ]?\d{2,3}[ ]?[A-Z]{3}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:num[=C4=83a]r pl[=C4=83a]cu[=C8=9Bt][=C4=
=83a] [=C3=AEi]nmatriculare|numar de inmatriculare|num[=C4=83a]r [=C3=AEi]n=
matriculare|nr [=C3=AEi]nmatriculare|num[=C4=83a]r auto|num[=C4=83a]r vehic=
ul|pl[=C4=83a]cu[=C8=9Bt][=C4=83a] [=C3=AEi]nmatriculare|placuta|matricula|=
masina|inregistrat)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">A 12 ABC</td>
</tr>
