<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank account number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Romania Bank Account Number matche=
s a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords w=
ithin a proximity of 10 terms: num=C4=83r de cont bancar, detalii banc=C4=
=83, num=C4=83r cont, cod cont, id cont, nr cont (or) cont bancar.&nbsp;(Al=
l terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d[A-Z]\d{14}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:num[=C4=83a]r de cont bancar|detalii banc=
[=C4=83a]|num[=C4=83a]r cont|cod cont|id cont|nr cont|cont bancar)</td>
</tr>
